# Optional: override automatic Blender detection
# BLENDER_PATH=C:\Program Files\Blender Foundation\Blender 4.3\blender.exe
# Settings are also editable in the app. Keys never return to the browser.
# When AI is enabled, preview images (max 1024px), selected surface references,
# model features and instructions are sent. Original model files remain local.
# Example: Qwen3.8-Flash on Alibaba Model Studio (Beijing).
# You can instead choose a provider preset in AI Settings.
# Use that provider's own API key; a gateway token is not an official-provider key.
# AI_PROVIDER=openai
# AI_BASE_URL=https://dashscope.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1
# AI_API_KEY=
# AI_MODEL=qwen3.8-flash
# AI_ENABLED=1
# For OpenAI-compatible services use AI_PROVIDER=openai and its own URL/model.
# Vision inherits the main model when all independent fields are blank.
# Enable independent vision only if you need a separate model/account.
# AI_VISION_ENABLED=
# AI_VISION_PROVIDER=
# AI_VISION_BASE_URL=
# AI_VISION_MODEL=
# AI_VISION_API_KEY=
# GPT-5.5 is disabled by the application's model policy; select another model.
# Instruction agents: a verifier re-checks the planner's part selections, and
# when a requirement is left pending a locator and a finisher make bounded
# extra model calls to complete it. AI_AGENT_TEAM=0 turns all of them off.
# AI_AGENT_TEAM=1
# AI_AGENT_VERIFY=1
# AI_AGENT_MAX_CALLS=6
# Usage scenes with people or a real place are made by an image model from
# renders of the product (the renders are the only images sent). On HAI nothing
# needs setting: the main token, the gateway's OpenAI route and gpt-image-2 are
# used. Elsewhere give an OpenAI Images API base URL and model; a key is only
# reused for the same endpoint. Quality is low, medium or high (cost rises).
# AI_IMAGE_ENABLED=1
# AI_IMAGE_BASE_URL=https://api.hai.network/openai/v1
# AI_IMAGE_MODEL=gpt-image-2
# AI_IMAGE_API_KEY=
# AI_IMAGE_QUALITY=medium
# Icons for the text layer come from the open sets shipped in static/vendor/icons
# (Lucide ISC, Tabler MIT). A search in the panel with "同时在线查找" ticked, and
# the automatic icon choice when a vision model is set up to look at the
# results, also ask Iconify's public API (api.iconify.design), taking only sets
# under MIT, ISC or Apache-2.0. Only the icon words are sent, nothing about the
# product. AI_ICON_ONLINE=0 keeps every search to the shipped sets.
# AI_ICON_ONLINE=1
# STUDIO_PORT=8765
# Optional native Cinema 4D export (requires a licensed c4dpy installation)
# C4DPY_PATH=C:\Program Files\Maxon Cinema 4D R24\c4dpy.exe
# C4D_EXPORT_TIMEOUT=120
